OL,3,AVeteran Indian actor Nana Patekar dies
OL,4,Aat 75
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran Indian actor Nana Patekar,
OL,7,Fknown for his intense performances and
OL,8,Fdistinct dialogue delivery, has died at
OL,9,Fthe age of 75 in Goa, his son Malhar
OL,10,Ftold BBC Marathi.
OL,12,FOne of the most recognisable faces of
OL,13,FIndian cinema, Patekar won three
OL,14,FNational Film Awards and became known
OL,15,Ffor playing complex, often volatile
OL,16,Fcharacters. He was also a prominent
OL,17,Ffigure in Marathi language cinema and
OL,18,Ftheatre.
OL,20,FHe was rushed to hospital after being
OL,21,Ffound unconscious at his home in Goa in
OL,22,Fthe early hours of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
